جا یه خط/ناحیه‌ی قیمت pivot سبزه\n\nفضای بین خط‌های صورتی session ماست","ib":{"dd59406b6137ce5edc49da57934dad97f6cba42f":6,"6ab444203c39aa127ebacf12a8223e08717b565d":8},"m":129},{"id":"readingsession_p5_130","t":"space between blue lines will be my session","a":"minimalmonk","d":"17 Oct 2012 20:13","r":"","n":"#130","p":5,"im":["492a9c40b53442768db7197d9fb8d7914e0b4aa4","fc9cf71d614b06d2580a9227b8d32a8ae5297150"],"fa":"فضای بین خط‌های آبی، session من خواهد بود","ib":{"492a9c40b53442768db7197d9fb8d7914e0b4aa4":1,"fc9cf71d614b06d2580a9227b8d32a8ae5297150":1},"m":130},{"id":"readingsession_p5_131","t":"few zones on m5.\n\nand first part of my mess ^^\n\nof course every comment are very welcome.\n\nPS Mr. If! have a look here and leave a word about. your videos were my main learning materials. Thanks 4all.\n\n/cheers","a":"minimalmonk","d":"17 Oct 2012 20:19","r":"","n":"#131","p":5,"im":["b8dfcffa98b2012ac25dbed4da6dda2318626e9c","73847e20e640853af31e7b716dbe9425810f80eb"],"fa":"چند تا ناحیه روی m5.\n\nو قسمت اول به‌هم‌ریختگی من ^^\n\nالبته همه نظرها خیلی خوش‌آمده.\n\nPS آقای If! اینجا نگاه کن و یه واژه درباره‌ش بگو. ویدئوهایت مواد یادگیری اصلی من بودن. ممنون از همه.\n\n/cheers 4all","ib":{"b8dfcffa98b2012ac25dbed4da6dda2318626e9c":1,"73847e20e640853af31e7b716dbe9425810f80eb":2},"m":131},{"id":"readingsession_p5_132","t":"Really impressive work MM\n\nYou've really put in the effort, and it WILL pay off","a":"Ifmyante","d":"17 Oct 2012 20:46","r":"Grand Master","n":"#132","p":5,"im":[],"fa":"کار واقعاً چشمگیری MM\n\nواقعاً زحمت کشیدی، و WILL به ثمر می‌شینه","m":132},{"id":"readingsession_p5_133","t":"Reading it as I go. Happy with the entry (demo).","a":"Oedipus99","d":"18 Oct 2012 10:56","r":"","n":"#133","p":5,"im":["0a857f458eab4f51b3fb0759702a0f70e9a1f46a"],"fa":"همون‌طور که پیش می‌رم می‌خونمش. از ورود راضی‌ام (demo).","ib":{"0a857f458eab4f51b3fb0759702a0f70e9a1f46a":1},"m":133},{"id":"readingsession_p5_134","t":"I'm delighted ~^o^~\n\nI'm on that too, BTW:)","a":"I